IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROBE-SIGN.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-A        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
01  WS-B        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 0.01.
01  WS-OUT      PIC 9(5)V99.
01  WS-SIGNED   PIC S9(5)V99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    COMPUTE WS-OUT = WS-A - WS-B
    DISPLAY "unsigned " WS-OUT
    COMPUTE WS-OUT = WS-A - WS-B
        ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "size-error-fired"
    END-COMPUTE
    COMPUTE WS-SIGNED = WS-A - WS-B
    DISPLAY "signed " WS-SIGNED
    STOP RUN.
